<section class="section-block" id="recruitment">
  <h2>Postdoctoral and student opportunities</h2>
  <p>I welcome postdoctoral applications year-round and recruit 1–3 graduate students each year. The number of places at the master’s and doctoral levels has yet to be determined. Undergraduates are also welcome to join the group early in their studies and take part in research.</p>
  <p>To apply, email your CV, transcript and a research question that interests you to <a href="mailto:yanlin-wang@outlook.com">yanlin-wang@outlook.com</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="section-block" id="projects">
  <h2>Research projects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC), General Program: Software Evolution History-Driven Automated Defect Repair (2027–2030), PI.</li>
    <li>NSFC Major Research Plan: Neurosymbolic High-Confidence Code Generation and Optimization (2026–2029), Subproject PI.</li>
    <li>CCF–Huawei Populus Euphratica Fund: Efficient Long-Context Language Models for Software Development Tasks (2024–2025), PI.</li>
    <li>CCF–Huawei Populus Euphratica Fund: Self-Feedback for Prompt Engineering in Large Code Models (2023–2024), PI.</li>
    <li>Sun Yat-sen University Young Faculty Development Project (2023–2024), PI.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

